# GDScript

- Godot 4.7, typed GDScript 2.0.
- Gameplay scripts: `extends RefCounted`, `class_name` where shared; no scene tree access.
- Reuse existing types (`Catalog`, `GameSession`, `ShipAssembler`, `OwnedShip`, `InteractableDef`).
- After edits, run `./scripts/ci/check.sh` — the parse sweep loads every script in one process; Godot exit code alone is not reliable.
- Do not add GUT; put unit tests in `tests/` with `TestRunner`.
